k8coins

Adapted from DockerCoins, part of jpetazzo/container.training
(https://github.com/jpetazzo/container.training), Copyright Jerome
Petazzoni and contributors, licensed under the Apache License 2.0.

Changes made: Dockerfiles rewritten for multi-stage builds, non-root
users, and healthchecks; dependency manifests (requirements.txt, Gemfile,
package.json and their lockfiles) added where the original installed
packages at build time. Application logic (rng, hasher, worker, webui) is
functionally the same as the original, apart from a Sinatra
host-authorization setting in hasher.rb that is commented in place.
